ates Map 2.", ["|7"] = "if you've cleared Colkhab (have Aged Matriarch Naakual crest), via Ceizak Battlegrounds through Sih Gates Map 2.", ["|8"] = "if you've cleared Kumhau (have Aged Flashfrost Naakual crest), the gate at (D-8) of Woh Gates (Map 1, unlike the others!) will now be", ["|9"] = "if you've cleared none of them, you need to do the full traversal from the start of Outer Ra'Kaznar (where the Augural Conveyor is and the"}},
